        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Behold, the days are coming, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", when I will sow the house of Israel and the house of Judah with the seed of man and the seed of beast. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it shall come to pass that as I have watched over them to pluck up and break down, to overthrow, destroy, and bring evil, so I will watch over them to build and to plant, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In those days they shall no longer say:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
