              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Behold, the days are coming, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", when I will make a new covenant with the house of Israel and the house of Judah, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "not like the covenant which I made with their fathers when I took them by the hand to bring them out of the land of Egypt, my covenant which they broke, though I was their husband, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But this is the covenant which I will make with the house of Israel after those days, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ": I will put my law within them, and I will write it upon their hearts; and I will be their God, and they shall be my people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And no longer shall each man teach his neighbor and each his brother, saying, ‘Know the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ",’ for they shall all know me, from the least of them to the greatest, says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; for I will forgive their iniquity, and I will remember their sin no more.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
