          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Behold, the days are coming says the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", when the city shall be rebuilt for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " from the tower of Hananel to the Corner Gate. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the measuring line shall go out farther, straight to the hill Gareb, and shall then turn to Goah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 31:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The whole valley of the dead bodies and the ashes, and all the fields as far as the brook Kidron, to the corner of the Horse Gate toward the east, shall be sacred to the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". It shall not be uprooted or overthrown any more for ever.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.31.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.31.40"
            ]
          }
        }
